## Public API

```python
from residual_void import (
    ResidualVoid,
    ResidualNetworkManager,
    SecureNode,
    CoherentField,
    CoherentVoid,
    Residual,
)
```

Optional geometry / mind layers are also importable:

```python
from residual_void import ResidualGeometry, ResidualFieldMind
```

